</span><span id="__span-31-26"><a id="__codelineno-31-26" name="__codelineno-31-26" href="#__codelineno-31-26"></a><span class="w">    </span><span class="sd">&quot;&quot;&quot;Retrieves the current weather report for a specified city.</span>
