</span><span id="__span-32-41"><a id="__codelineno-32-41" name="__codelineno-32-41" href="#__codelineno-32-41"></a><span class="n">session_service</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">InMemorySessionService</span><span class="p">()</span>
